  (text "Talk keys and key lights\nC&K PTS815 under each keycap, red 0603 LED inside the cap, about 5 mA"
    (at 22 26 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "e9e4c1f9-cb39-4de4-8e89-fb5a1d443140"))
  (text "Status lights\nRed + green 0603 pair under each end light pipe"
    (at 198 26 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "093a5eb7-4bd1-4f4e-9b2d-b0447fa6b3bb"))
  (text "IO expander, I2C address 0x20\nKeys in, key/status lights and OLED reset out.\nThe I2C pull-ups live here; leave them off the main PCB."
    (at 22 104 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "6f666a34-77a2-4000-b85b-dda54135c201"))
  (text "OLED: 1.3 in 128x64 white, GME12864-110 (SH1106)\nI2C mode, address 0x3C. 30-pin 0.5 mm FPC into a ZIF on B.\nCheck the pin map and contact side against your panel's drawing."
    (at 160 104 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "186d65cf-139c-4952-922b-eb3616fc73b1"))
  (text "Dials: Bourns PEC12R-4215F-N0024 on the B side\nDatasheet RC filter on A and B (10k pull-up, 10k series, 10 nF)"
    (at 288 84 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "c8bb6c0f-e61c-4e3c-a37d-d5305c546db0"))
  (text "Link to the main PCB: JST SH 10-way, 50 mm cable\n1 GND, 2 +3V3, 3 SDA, 4 SCL, 5 INT, 6-9 dial A/B, 10 GND"
    (at 288 200 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "c7637a04-2204-44fa-acd2-18d821dfbeaf"))
  (text "M2 mounting holes into the top-plate bosses"
    (at 22 240 0)
    (effects
      (font
